==To Start==
Speak with [[Sirdo "Squirrel Chaser"]] located South-East of the [[Blackspore]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
==Goals==
Steal some supplies from the nearby camps. Don't feel bad. I need them more than they do.
*Steal some supplies
*Steal some supplies
*Return to Sirdo 
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Sirdo "Squirrel Chaser"]] located South-East of the [[Blackspore]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"Don't laugh at my name! I used to be the best thief around until I botched my last mission and earned this ridiculous nickname.<br />I need to rebuild my reputation as a ruthless thug. But let's start small... Help me swipe some <font color='#d9781a'>supplies</font> from the <font color='#d9781a'>nearby camps</font>, and I promise you a nice reward when we're done." -Sirdo "Squirrel Chaser"
#Steal some supplies
#*Steal some supplies from [[Mucklewhump]]'s camp.
#Steal some supplies
#*Steal some supplies from [[Sal Monella]]'s camp.
#Speak with [[Sirdo "Squirrel Chaser"]] located South-East of the [[Blackspore]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"You swiped the supplies? Fantastic! We're one step closer to proving my worth once again!<br />Maybe with a little more work, people will finally forget that I royally screwed up my last mission."<small>-Sirdo "Squirrel Chaser"</small>
